<!-- pages/partner/customers/index.wxml · 客户列表（只列已被顾客绑定的顾客；无任何添加/绑定/导入入口） -->
<view class="page-body">
  <switch-bar />
  <view class="row between head">
    <view class="title">{{headingText}}</view>
    <view class="row">
      <view class="btn btn-ghost head-btn" bindtap="onCopyPartnerNo">复制兼职编号</view>
      <view wx:if="{{showCreateEntry}}" class="btn btn-primary head-btn" bindtap="goCreateOnBehalf">代客下单</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{bannerText}}" class="card banner-card row between" bindtap="onDismissBanner">
    <view class="strong banner-text">{{bannerText}}</view>
    <view class="muted">关闭</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card search-card">
    <input
      class="form-input"
      placeholder="搜索：楼栋 / 宿舍 / 称呼 / 尾号 / 顾客编号"
      value="{{keyword}}"
      confirm-type="search"
      bindinput="onKeywordInput"
      bindconfirm="onKeywordConfirm"
    />
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{staleText}}" class="card stale-card">
    <view class="small">{{staleText}}<text wx:if="{{lastSuccessText}}"> · {{lastSuccessText}}</text></view>
  </view>

  <block wx:if="{{mode === 'skeleton'}}">
    <view wx:for="{{skeletonRows}}" wx:key="*this" class="card skeleton-card row">
      <view class="skeleton-avatar"></view>
      <view class="flex-1 skeleton-main">
        <view class="skeleton-line"></view>
        <view class="skeleton-line short"></view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </block>

  <view wx:elif="{{mode === 'error'}}" class="card">
    <empty-state text="{{errorText}}" actionText="重试" bind:action="onRetry" />
  </view>

  <view wx:elif="{{mode === 'empty'}}" class="card">
    <empty-state text="{{emptyText}}" actionText="{{emptyActionText}}" bind:action="onEmptyAction" />
  </view>

  <block wx:else>
    <view
      wx:for="{{rows}}"
      wx:key="bindingId"
      class="card customer-item row"
      data-index="{{index}}"
      bindtap="onRowTap"
    >
      <avatar-view fileId="{{item.avatarFileId}}" name="{{item.displayName}}" size="{{64}}" />
      <view class="flex-1 customer-main">
        <view class="row between">
          <view class="strong ellipsis">{{item.displayNameText}}</view>
          <view wx:if="{{item.activeOrderCountText}}" class="tag">{{item.activeOrderCountText}}</view>
        </view>
        <view class="muted ellipsis">{{item.anchorKeyText}}</view>
        <view class="row between meta-row">
          <view class="small">{{item.phoneTailText}}<text wx:if="{{item.boundAtText}}"> · 绑定 {{item.boundAtText}}</text></view>
          <view
            wx:if="{{showCreateEntry}}"
            class="btn btn-ghost row-btn"
            data-binding-id="{{item.bindingId}}"
            catchtap="goCreateOnBehalf"
          >代客下单</view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{footerText}}" class="footer-text">{{footerText}}</view>
  </block>

  <view class="bottom-actions">
    <block wx:if="{{!session}}">
      <button wx:if="{{showShare}}" class="btn btn-ghost btn-block share-btn" open-type="share">
        分享绑定卡片（顾客自己发起绑定）
      </button>
    </block>
  </view>
</view>
